  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nx = √2 + 1\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\n(a + b)² = a² + 2ab + b²\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ x = √2 + 1\n\n⇒ x² = (√2 + 1)²\n\n⇒ x² = (√2)² + 2(√2)(1) + (1)²\n\n⇒ x² = 2 + 2√2 + 1\n\n⇒ x² = 3 + 2√2\n\n⇒ x² - 2 = (3 + 2√2) - 2\n\n⇒ x² - 2 = 1 + 2√2\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 1 + 2√2.**",
